WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.551
Welcome to Grade 3 English, Unit
1: All About Me and My Family.

2
00:00:04.631 --> 00:00:09.770
In this unit you will learn how to
talk about yourself and your family,

3
00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:16.312
and about the values that hold a family and
a school together: respect, honour, and duty.

4
00:00:16.392 --> 00:00:23.662
You will learn how to behave well in public and in
private, and how to talk about health and safety.

5
00:00:23.742 --> 00:00:32.262
By the end you will introduce your family, ask Wh- questions,
give clear instructions, and share what matters to you,

6
00:00:32.342 --> 00:00:35.129
just as Amal does in this unit's story.

7
00:00:35.209 --> 00:00:41.303
In this short lecture, preview the key
ideas and prepare for the independent lesson.

8
00:00:41.383 --> 00:00:49.434
By the end of this unit, you will be able to talk about
the people in your family and what you do together.

9
00:00:49.514 --> 00:00:55.134
You will also use new words like
respect, honour, duty, health, and safety.

10
00:00:55.214 --> 00:01:01.745
You will also say what is happening now,
using the present continuous (“I am helping.”)

11
00:01:01.825 --> 00:01:04.556
Keep these goals in mind as you work.

12
00:01:04.636 --> 00:01:10.316
Your vocabulary work begins with these words:
family, parent, friend, student, junior, senior.

13
00:01:10.396 --> 00:01:15.279
Listen to each pronunciation in the
vocabulary lab, study its meaning in context,

14
00:01:15.359 --> 00:01:19.139
and use the word accurately in
your own discussion and writing.

15
00:01:19.219 --> 00:01:23.149
The reading sequence includes My
Family and Good Behaviour at School.

16
00:01:23.229 --> 00:01:23.963
Read actively.

17
00:01:24.043 --> 00:01:27.973
Identify each text's central ideas,
notice viewpoint and reliability,

18
00:01:28.053 --> 00:01:31.751
and support every inference with
relevant evidence from the text.

19
00:01:31.831 --> 00:01:36.324
The first language focus is Present
Continuous (what is happening now).

20
00:01:36.404 --> 00:01:41.542
We use the present continuous to talk
about actions that are happening right now.

21
00:01:41.622 --> 00:01:47.983
It helps us say exactly what people are doing at
this moment, like “The student is showing respect.”

22
00:01:48.063 --> 00:01:55.004
Notice the structure in the model examples, then apply
it deliberately in connected sentences and paragraphs.

23
00:01:55.084 --> 00:01:59.175
In speaking, you will complete
Speaking 1 — Introduce Your Family.

24
00:01:59.255 --> 00:02:03.409
Organise your ideas, use evidence
and respond clearly to questions.

25
00:02:03.489 --> 00:02:06.632
In writing, you will plan, draft, check and revise.

26
00:02:06.712 --> 00:02:09.981
Use the success criteria before submitting your work.

27
00:02:10.061 --> 00:02:11.530
You are ready to begin.

28
00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:18.195
Start with the vocabulary lab, continue through
reading and comprehension, apply the grammar focus,

29
00:02:18.275 --> 00:02:21.426
and complete the speaking and writing practices.

30
00:02:21.506 --> 00:02:28.899
Use AI English for hints and feedback any time, and bring
your questions to a live session too if you join one.
